---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy — LimeBeam"
  description="LimeBeam privacy policy: no data collected, everything stays on your device."
  altHref="/privacy"
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated: June 16, 2026</p>

  <p>
    LimeBeam is an IPTV player. This policy explains what data is — and, above
    all, is not — handled when you use the app.
  </p>

  <h2>No data collected</h2>
  <p>
    LimeBeam collects, transmits and sells no personal data. There is no
    LimeBeam account, no LimeBeam server and no user profile on the publisher's
    side.
  </p>

  <h2>Data stored on your device</h2>
  <p>
    Your source credentials (Xtream Codes / M3U), favorites, playback history
    and preferences are stored <strong>locally only</strong>, on your device.
    Sensitive credentials are kept in the system secure storage (Keychain on
    iOS, Keystore on Android). Nothing is sent to the publisher.
  </p>

  <h2>Network connections</h2>
  <p>
    The app connects only to the IPTV server <strong>you</strong> configure, to
    fetch and play your own streams. LimeBeam provides no content and hosts no
    channels, movies or series. Any data exchanged with your provider is
    governed by that provider's own privacy policy.
  </p>

  <h2>In-app purchases (tips)</h2>
  <p>
    The "Support the developer" screen offers optional tips through in-app
    purchases. These transactions are handled entirely by Apple (App Store) or
    Google (Play Store); LimeBeam receives and stores no payment data. A tip
    unlocks no content or feature.
  </p>

  <h2>No ads, no tracking</h2>
  <p>
    LimeBeam shows no ads and bundles no analytics, tracking or audience-measurement
    SDK.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    The app is not directed at children and knowingly collects no data about
    them. A PIN-based parental control is available in settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    This policy may be updated. Any change will be posted on this page with a new
    "last updated" date.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions: <a href="mailto:limebeam@clemichelabs.com">limebeam@clemichelabs.com</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
